  "stem_markdown": "(7) 设A是\"阶方阵，且AAT = E, | A |< 0,则丨A + E丨=________ .",
  "answer_markdown": "0.",
  "analysis_markdown": "0.\n解\n将A+E变成矩阵乘积的形式，\n| A + E | = | A + AAT | = | A(E + AT) | = I A | | E + AT |\n=| A | | ET+AT | = | A | | (E + A)T |-=| A | | E + A | ,\n故(1-| A |) | A + E |= 0,由 |A|<0,知 1—|A |> 0,所以丨 A + E 丨=0.",
